(This study asks whether supplied attributes distinguish distribution-transformer records) Tj T*
(with annual burn labels, and what an assumed intervention budget buys in customer-) Tj T*
(interruption risk. The complete public register is used. It does not estimate the) Tj T*
(treatment effect of maintenance, diagnose individual equipment or recommend a utility) Tj T*
(capital plan.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The source is Mendeley Data version 4, DOI 10.17632/yzyj46xpmy.4, published 17 September) Tj T*
(2021. The creators are Diego A Bravo M, Carlos Lozano and Laura Alvarez. The source) Tj T*
(assigns Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International. DATA.md contains the attribution) Tj T*
(and source licence description verbatim, plus the complete public licence. Raw workbooks) Tj T*
(are unmodified; derived tables and renamed fields are modifications. No endorsement is) Tj T*
(implied. Source metadata, file sizes, hashes and exact headers are frozen in) Tj T*
(data/manifest.json.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The landing page describes an approximately 16,000-transformer register covering 42) Tj T*
(municipalities. Both annual files contain 15,873 source records with 16 fields. The) Tj T*
(earlier file has 807 burned labels and the test file has 629. These are annual binary) Tj T*
(labels, with no individual failure dates. Every record is preserved, including anonymous) Tj T*
(repeated rows. The denominators refer to published records, not a independently verified) Tj T*
(count of distinct physical assets. Counts: outputs/audit.json; schemas:) Tj T*
(data/manifest.json.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The classification estimand is the conditional probability of a supplied annual burn) Tj T*
(label given the permitted attributes. Power, protection, lightning exposure, connectors,) Tj T*
(client and installation types, users, overhead-network and circuit-queue flags are) Tj T*
(predictors. The LOCATION field is binary; it is not a municipality key. Burning rate is) Tj T*
(excluded because its observation window is undefined and it may encode the target.) Tj T*
(Derived criticality and unsupplied energy are also excluded because their construction) Tj T*
(or temporal availability is unclear. Network length is excluded because its units need) Tj T*
(verification. Predictor choices: config/study.json.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(No installation dates, ages, identities, feeder keys or observed condition measurements) Tj T*
(are provided. Consequently age-only, condition-health and survival-time comparisons are) Tj T*
(unavailable. The study does not invent those inputs or reinterpret the annual label as a) Tj T*
(condition measurement. Undocumented feature timestamps prevent a prospective forecast) Tj T*
(claim even after grouped validation. These boundaries govern both the evaluation and the) Tj T*
(capital scenario.) Tj T*
